{"id":"vod_bf_40005","vodId":"40005","provider":"bf","providerName":"暴风资源","type":2,"name":"新妹魔王的契约者第二季","name_cn":"新妹魔王的契约者第二季","date":"2015-01-01","year":"2015","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://img.bfzypic.com/upload/vod/20230424-41/851502eff51a926e13ecc19854705d19.jpg"},"summary":"《新妹魔王的契约者 BURST》是电视动画《新妹魔王的契约者》的第二期，改编自上栖缀人原作、大熊猫介插画的轻小说。“开始吧。决定这魔界未来的战斗——”把盯上澪所拥有的先代魔王之力的佐基尔打倒之后，刃更等人似乎取回了一时的平稳。他和澪以及柚希她们一同准备体育祭，讴歌着慌张的日常生活，但某一天，他们突然遭到被魔法操纵的人类袭击……。为了守护家人，为了变强，刃更他们以更加激烈的方式增强了主从契约。在他们面前，万理亚的姐姐露绮亚现身，由此，他们被卷入了震撼魔界的战斗当中……想要守护，重要的家人。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-04-29 22:57:30","playable":true,"episodeCount":11,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"bfzym3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/xinmeimowangdeqiyuezhedierji/第01集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/xinmeimowangdeqiyuezhedierji/第02集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/xinmeimowangdeqiyuezhedierji/第03集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/xinmeimowangdeqiyuezhedierji/第04集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/xinmeimowangdeqiyuezhedierji/第05集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/xinmeimowangdeqiyuezhedierji/第06集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/xinmeimowangdeqiyuezhedierji/第07集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/xinmeimowangdeqiyuezhedierji/第08集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/xinmeimowangdeqiyuezhedierji/第09集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/xinmeimowangdeqiyuezhedierji/第10集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/xinmeimowangdeqiyuezhedierji/第11集/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T09:33:21.638Z"}